# Lessons

When work in this repo teaches something about a control, a platform, or how cost in one place shows up in the rest of the app, record it in a `LESSONS.md` beside that code.

- Collection lessons go in `MauiLab/Collections/LESSONS.md`.
- Layout lessons go in `MauiLab/Layouts/LESSONS.md`.
- Use the same pattern for other feature folders. Create the file if it is missing.
- Add a short heading and a few sentences. Update an existing note when the same lesson changes.
- Keep it to behavior that would surprise the next change: what broke, why, and what to do instead.
- Do not record secrets, task checklists, or a diary of the edit.
